{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Today's your wedding day, and you've never met your husband.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're the chief of several semi-nomadic clans; he's an imperial prince of the Han people, with whom you have a complicated political relationship. You meet for the first time on the same day you marry, and you quickly find that he isn't the arrogant, prideful prince you'd expected.<br>Get to know him over the night and find out whether he's a spy for your enemies or a victim of political schemes; and most of all, whether this marriage can work.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br>35k words (1-2 hours of reading)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One husband, who may turn into a love interest, friend, or remain a stranger</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 CGs (4 NSFW)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 endings to the wedding night</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 epilogues and 3 extras after the wedding night, showing how your choices have shaped your relationship</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ending 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814010/17752bdd94cdd26c11d2eba1cc84550c4eb9814f.jpg"},{"name":"Ending 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814010/7da1550069394b49947e47a1fa26fcfce0a352dd.jpg"},{"name":"Ending 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814010/d13724eb656ffb2469794fdd5cf8f23f78552a8f.jpg"},{"name":"Ending 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814010/785f5cd49d21694a544b246d65790bc42836cb32.jpg"},{"name":"Ending 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814010/f376d8b974083c1b0d76c9aefc1029a7f4aa4a5d.jpg"},{"name":"Change of Heart","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814010/822bf381246b10678d0ab6ff4ccba906f56695b6.jpg"},{"name":"Cold to the end","path":"https://cdn.